@startuml dashboard_owned_distribution
component "Dashboard active UI/config" as Dashboard
component "Original RainbowKit2.2.11 tarball" as Upstream
component "repack.py
SRI + exact metadata delta" as Recipe
component "IFR-owned immutable tarball" as Owned
component "CSS1.21.3" as CSS
component "deepmerge-ts" as Merge
Upstream --> Recipe : verified bytes; no target execution
Recipe --> Owned : all payload preserved except 3 metadata values
Dashboard ..> Owned : open normal local-tarball dependency
Owned --> CSS : exact declared dependency
CSS --> Merge : published replacement
@enduml
